          help_text: The Conjur variable path for the SSL passphrase (e.g., production/nginx/ssl_passphrase)
        - id: conjur_api_key
          type: string
          label: Conjur API Key
          secret: true
          help_text: The API key or host factory token used to authenticate the Ansible controller or target node with CyberArk Conjur
        - id: ssl_passphrase
          type: string
          label: SSL Passphrase
          secret: true
          help_text: The passphrase retrieved from Conjur at path production/nginx/ssl_passphrase, passed as -passout to openssl req when generating private 
            keys for test.cluster.local, ci.cluster.local, and status.cluster.local
